The bug in PC overlay manager has been discovered.  The fix is
non-trivial, and the PC overlay team is working on it.  No exact
estimate yet, but "soon."  There is a side-benefit to this delay:
lots of bugs are getting fixed for Pl8.  Please keep sending
reports.

In response to a question on this newsgroup:  Apart from the overlay
bug, Pl8 is ready for release.  It will be released as a set of
patches, but soon afterwards the full NetHack (Pl8) code will be
re-posted on comp.sources.games.  It will be up to you whether to use
the patch kit or to wait a little longer for the full release.

For the Development Team

